# CipherMeet — Full Build Task Checklist

## Phase 1: Backend (NestJS)
- [x] **1.1** Expand [main.ts](file:///c:/Railan/New folder/ciphermeet/cipher-meet-backend/src/main.ts) — Helmet, CORS, Swagger, global pipes, WebSocket adapter
