- [x] **1.8** Key Exchange Module — X3DH pre-key bundles, SPK rotation (Signal Protocol)
- [x] **1.9** Security Module — 2FA TOTP, active sessions, activity log
- [x] **1.10** Premium Module — subscription tiers, incognito, super likes
- [x] **1.11** Database schemas — TypeORM entities (PG) + Mongoose schemas (Mongo)
- [x] **1.12** Docker Compose — Postgres, MongoDB, Redis services + multi-stage Dockerfile
- [x] **1.13** Environment config — [.env.example](file:///c:/Railan/New folder/ciphermeet/cipher-meet-mobile/.env.example), ConfigModule
